  "rationale": [
    "14px base and a tight 1.125 UI ratio: 50 rows on screen without losing scanability.",
    "Orange is a signature for 'moving' states, 28° from error red; it is never used for errors and always has a label.",
    "One blue for actions + info."
  ],
